<title>USA: BPI Packaging names new CFO.</title>
<headline>BPI Packaging names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>N. DIGHTON, Mass. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPI Packaging Technologies Inc, which makes plastic grocery bags and plastic film products, said on Friday that it has named Jack Wallace its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wallace was previously a senior partner of the public accounting firm Wallace, Savage &amp; Danehy, P.C., in Massachusetts.  </p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment on whom Wallace was replacing as CFO.</p>
